</div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Eremo.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Eremo%27s%20Island\">Eremo's Island</a>, a small island between <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Cormaya\">Cormaya</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>You can only reach Eremo by asking <a href=\"#/wiki/Pemaret\">Pemaret</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Cormaya\">Cormaya</a> for a passage to <a href=\"#/wiki/Eremo%27s%20Island\">Eremo's Island</a>. To go back from, talk to Eremo and say <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">Cormaya</span>, <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">Tibia</span>, <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">back</span>, or <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">teleport</span>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buys\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buys\">Buys</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th></th><th>Item</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Amulet of Loss\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Amulet_of_Loss_ce68af.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td>Amulet of Los